{"seq":2,"slug":"tools-frameworks","title":"测试工具与框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terratest-pulumi-testing","title":"Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/terratest-pulumi-testing","wordCount":1152,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-testing-opa-sentinel","title":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel","wordCount":1049,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"container-image-testing","title":"容器镜像测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/container-image-testing","wordCount":1230,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 测试工具与框架\n\n本章深入三类核心工具：通用 IaC 测试框架（Terratest、Pulumi 内置测试、OpenTofu 原生 test）、策略即代码引擎（OPA/Conftest、HashiCorp Sentinel、Pulumi CrossGuard）、以及容器镜像的安全与合规扫描工具链（Trivy、Grype、Syft）。\n\n每篇文档侧重工具的设计哲学、核心 API 与实战模式，而非罗列命令手册。读者应在阅读基础章节后进入本章，根据团队技术栈选择对应工具深入。\n"}